      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Mitchell%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Old Federal Road, once a postal route, connected Washington and New Orleans, passing through the area now known as Fort Mitchell.",
